  m_text: 'Changes the Skybox Color. Reset will go back to default color (basically
    no color).


    If no end tick is set, it will go to that color instantly.

    If
    an end tick is set however, it will transition to that color over time.


    The
    Skybox will keep the color. If you want it to end, you have to place a Skybox
    with RESET checked.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
