  m_text: 'changes the speed of the song.


    this modifier requires an end tick.
    the speed will gradually fade from current to the amount you set from start to
    end tick.


    to reset back to original speed, place another modifier that
    fades back to 100% speed.


    <b><color=#FFA8A8>lowering the speed can cause
    long chains to break. please be aware.</color><b>'
