    <color=#FDA50F>continuous</color> will continuously
    rotate the arena until end tick.

    <color=#FDA50F>incremental</color> will
    increase the rotation speed from start to end tick, ending at speed set in amount.


    <color=#FDA50F>requires
    arena loader mod!</color>'
