  m_text: 'you can fully customize your modifier tracks. when you create a new map,
    the track arrangement gets created based on your template. aftewards, you can
    further edit the arrangement on a per-map basis. note that you can have multiple
    tracks of the same type, or none.


    <b>template</b>

    to edit the template,
    click the edit button, followed by the settings button. in there, you can re-order,
    add and remove tracks to your liking. whatever you set up here is what will be
    used when a new map is created.


    <b>map sepcific arrangement</b>

    to
    edit the track arrangement for a map specifically, also click the edit button,
    then rearrange to your liking.'
