  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'changes the player''s arena


    use the arena name (using the in-game
    display name it uses). Most of the time, it''s just the filename <color=#FDA50F>without</color>
    ending, e.g. cloudy


    default arenas are called environment1-5, e.g. environment2


    <color=#FDA50F>preload</color>
    will change the arena upon selecting the song.


    it will always try to change
    to the first entered arena. if the player doesn''t have that arena, it will try
    to change to arena option 2. if that isn''t found either, nothing will happen.


    you
    can use sustains before an arena change - they can be held throughout. other
    than that, don''t place any targets for around 8 seconds after using this modifier,
    since the player''s view will be blacked out for that time.


    <color=#FDA50F>requires
    arena loader mod!</color>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d6ffc87ae696bb49b961911c4703d7d, type: 2}
