  m_text: 'changes the player''s target colors.


    <color=#FDA50F>color change</color>
    remains active until the end of the map if no end tick is set.


    <color=#FDA50F>color
    update</color> can only be set during an active color change modifier. remains
    active for as long as color change is active, or unti lanother color update is
    placed.


    <color=#FDA50F>color swap</color> swaps the players left and right
