  m_text: "displays a text popup in the center of the player's playing field.\n\n<color=#FDA50F>offset</color>
    values allow you to position the text. \n<color=#FDA50F>font size</color> allows
    you to specify the text size. if you leave this empty, it will default to a size
    of 20.\n<color=#FDA50F>glow</color> makes the text glow.\n\nmultiple text popups
    can be created at the same time.\n\nremains active until the end of the song
    if no end tick is set."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8d6ffc87ae696bb49b961911c4703d7d, type: 2}
